00:08:57.780 --> 00:08:58.820
Did you, Amge?

209
00:08:58.920 --> 00:09:00.640
Did you play any of the games?

210
00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:02.540
No, I didn't.

211
00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:02.920
Did you?

212
00:09:03.120 --> 00:09:03.560
Oh, yeah.

213
00:09:04.220 --> 00:09:04.880
You did?

214
00:09:05.140 --> 00:09:05.580
Oh, yeah.

215
00:09:05.860 --> 00:09:08.560
There were any time that I was sitting.

216
00:09:08.720 --> 00:09:09.320
Well, you love poker.

