00:09:29.660 --> 00:09:30.640
didn't know how to play poker.

225
00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:32.360
I only just learned I'm not great.

226
00:09:32.580 --> 00:09:35.120
I mean, I always think I can win with a pair of threes.

227
00:09:35.320 --> 00:09:36.760
I'm that I'm basically Phyllis.

228
00:09:36.900 --> 00:09:37.540
You can.

229
00:09:37.900 --> 00:09:38.580
I know.

230
00:09:38.860 --> 00:09:44.120
But I'm basically, you know, Phyllis like, oh, look, the one with the flower won.

